Every item must include a reason.

---

# 1010. FINAL MASTER EXTERNAL BLOCKER SUMMARY

For every remaining hard blocker:

```text
BLOCKER:
EXTERNAL OWNER/DEPENDENCY:
WHY AGENT CANNOT COMPLETE:
WHAT HAS ALREADY BEEN COMPLETED:
EXACT REQUIRED ACTION:
WHAT SHOULD RUN NEXT AFTER UNBLOCK:
```

Do not use vague statements such as "need access" without specifying what access and why.

---

# 1011. FINAL SUPER ULTRA MEGA MANTRA

```text
FULL COVERAGE.
NO SHRINKING.

ONE SHOT.
NO CONTINUE PROMPTS.

DEPLOYMENT FIRST.
SECURITY AND DATA SAFETY ALWAYS.

AUDIT ALL APPLICABLE DOMAINS.
VERIFY WITH EVIDENCE.
CREATE FEWER, BETTER ISSUES.
FIX THE CRITICAL PATH.
VALIDATE EVERY CHANGE.
SYNC DOCUMENTATION.
KEEP ISSUE STATE TRUE.
KEEP DEPLOYMENT STATE TRUE.
KEEP REPOSITORY STATE CLEAN.
KEEP COMPLEXITY LOW.
KEEP NECESSARY COMPLEXITY EXPLICIT.
REMOVE DEAD SYSTEMS.
REMOVE DUPLICATE SOURCES OF TRUTH.
REMOVE USELESS ABSTRACTIONS.
CONTROL OPERATIONAL COST.
CONTROL AI TOKEN COST.
PRESERVE ROLLBACK.
